From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 08:52:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 7: diagnostics - per-cell debug labels, thumbnail
 fallback, scroll to newest

- Add displayName to MediaItem
- Temporary id/name label on each grid cell (SHOW_DEBUG_LABELS) to verify ordering vs adb
- If loadThumbnail fails, log it and fall back to Coil's default decoding
- Scroll to top when a newer item arrives and the user is near the top
---
